### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = buyer-secret-key-12345

@vendorId = cmpc2gjz90000ikli1cg4gmsj
@prodictId = cmp2rw7020001i8lienqogqky

@vendorId2 = cmp21j4xu0001zwli69agxgle

@andy = cmpvzfw5c000004jscdsssg2x

### =====================
### TESTS DE PRODUCTOS
### =====================

### Test 1: GET todos los productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 2: GET productos de un vendedor específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?vendorId={{andy}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 3: GET productos de múltiples vendedores
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?vendorId={{vendorId}},{{vendorId2}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 4: GET productos con rango de precio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=10&maxPrice=100
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 5: GET productos con filtros combinados (vendedor + precio)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?vendorId={{vendorId}}&minPrice=20&maxPrice=80
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 6: GET productos con solo minPrice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=50
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 7: GET productos con solo maxPrice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?maxPrice=50
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 8: GET sin API Key (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Test 9: GET con API Key incorrecta (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
X-API-Key: INVALIDA

### Test 10: GET con minPrice inválido (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=abc
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 11: GET con maxPrice inválido (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?maxPrice=xyz
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 12: GET con minPrice > maxPrice (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=100&maxPrice=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 13: GET con vendorId inválido/vacío (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?vendorId=
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 14: GET con vendorId que no existe (200, lista vacía)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?vendorId=vendor-inexistente
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 15: GET con múltiples vendedores donde algunos no existen (200, solo los existentes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?vendorId=ven-1,vendor-inexistente,ven-2
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 16: GET con precio negativo (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=-10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 17: GET con precio = 0 (200, válido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=0&maxPrice=0
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test 18: GET con parámetros combinados más complejos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?vendorId=ven-1,ven-2&minPrice=15.50&maxPrice=99.99
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
